{"id": "16412", "title": "明朝那些事儿", "author": "当年明月", "category": "历史军事", "count": 204, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/16/16412/16412s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/16/16412.htm", "intro": "朱元璋生于乱世之中，背负着父母双亡的痛苦，从赤贫起家，他没有背景，没有后台，没有依靠，他的一切都是自己争取来的，他经历千辛万苦，无数次躲过死神的掌握，从死人堆里爬起来，掩埋战友的尸体，然后继续前进，继续战斗。\r\n 　　朱元璋的那个时代有着无数的厉害角色，陈友谅、张士诚、王保保个个都不是省油的灯。朱元璋用他惊人的军事天赋战胜了这些敌人，可以说，在那个时代，最优秀统帅的称号非朱元璋莫属。\r\n 　　他几乎是赤手空拳，单枪匹马凭借着自己的勇气和决心建立了庞大的帝国。", "base": "files/article/html/16/16412", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "0001-0010", "file": "2600271.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0011-0020", "file": "2600272.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0021-0030", "file": "2600273.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0031-0040", "file": "2600274.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0041-0050", "file": "2600275.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0051-0060", "file": "2600276.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0061-0070", "file": "2600277.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0071-0080", "file": "2600278.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0081-0090", "file": "2600279.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0091-0100", "file": "2600280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0101-0110", "file": "2600281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0111-0120", "file": "2600282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0121-0130", "file": "2600283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0131-0140", "file": "2600284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0141-0150", "file": "2600285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0151-0160", "file": "2600286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0161-0170", "file": "2600287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0171-0180", "file": "2600288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0181-0190", "file": "2600289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0191-0200", "file": "2600290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0201-0210", "file": "2600291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0211-0220"